sonal data - age, gender, height, weight and fitness level<br>-   Set your desired workout location \u2013 gym or home<br>-   Choose which days and what times suit you to workout<br>-   Select the equipment available<br>-   Enter any health or training restrictions, from injuries to cardiovascular disease <br>-   Add personal reminders to ensure you never miss an opportunity to workout  <br>-   Take an AI test to measure your fitness level<br>-   Receive a personalized workout plan<br><br>Muscle Booster is the ultimate choice for home and gym workouts. Take on the challenge, lose weight, build muscle and strength, and change your life with your personalized gym workout planner. <br><br>Download the Muscle Booster app to boost your energy and health with effective workouts.<br><br>SUBSCRIPTION INFO<br>You can download the app for free and use limited functionality without payment. If you\u2019d like to have a full experience with the app, you will need a subscription.<br><br>In addition to the purchased subscription, we may offer you add-on items (e.g. fitness guides, VIP customer support service) for an additional fee, either one-off or recurrent. This purchase is optional: your subscription is not conditional on such a purchase. All such offers will be displayed in the app.<br><br>Muscle Booster Terms of Use: https://legal.muscle-booster.io/page/terms-of-use<br>Muscle Booster Privacy Notice: https://legal.muscle-booster.io/page/privacy-policy",
